UID:stanford_campus-localist-53625066788429-53625066788430@local-events
DESCRIPTION:Practical Geoengineering \n\nCarbon dioxide emissions seem set
  to peak this decade\, but even if emissions were suddenly reduced to zero
  Earth will stay hot for thousands of years. Cooling Earth this century re
 quires that emissions cuts be supplemented with either carbon removal or s
 unlight reflection\, or both. I will focus on practical steps towards sunl
 ight reflection using stratospheric sulfate aerosols that could enable a s
 ignificant decrease in warming by mid-century.\n\nBio\n\nDavid Keith has w
 or\n\nAges: All ages\nLast synced: 2026-11-05 12:29 PST
LOCATION:Polya Hall
END:VEVENT
