DESCRIPTION:Growing Up in Science (GUIS) is back for the 2026-2027 academi
 c year!\n\nIn most sessions\, one faculty member shares the personal side 
 of their individual journey through academia. Occasionally\, PhD-holding s
 peakers from outside the academic research environment may also speak. The
  stories focus on the struggles\, doubts\, weaknesses\, and failures we al
 l face as young scientists. GUIS aims to normalize discussing these person
 al and interpersonal challenges\, and supporting one another through them.
